units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

read_data convergence_test/vacuum_convergence/structures/FeNiAl_111_L10_vacuum8.data

pair_style meam
pair_coeff * * convergence_test/potential/library.meam Fe Ni Al convergence_test/potential/FeNiAl.meam Fe Ni Al

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 check yes

thermo 100
thermo_style custom step atoms pe press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz

min_style cg
minimize 0.0 1.0e-6 50000 500000

run 0

write_data convergence_test/vacuum_convergence/structures/FeNiAl_111_L10_vacuum8_relaxed.data
